{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ACT","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"使徒行传","commonName":"使徒行传","title":"使徒行传","order":44,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"781a2d740b63eac5d628fa7919bbf9194228702560287d7dfe223c5cbe8c77ad","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/ACT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/ACT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1007},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["随着信徒的数量快速增加，说希腊语的信徒开始与说阿拉姆语的信徒争论起来，",{"noteId":24},"抱怨在日常食物分配的过程中歧视他们的寡妇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["于是十二使徒召集众信徒，说：“我们要传讲上帝之道，让我们放弃这个使命去管理伙食，不太合适。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["兄弟们，从你们中间选出七个值得信赖、充满圣灵和智慧之人，我们会派他们负责此事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们要专心祈祷，行使传道的侍奉之责。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["这个安排让所有人都很满意。他们选出司提芬（一位全心相信上帝，充满圣灵之人）以及还有腓利、伯罗哥罗、尼加挪、提门、巴米拿以及归信犹太教的安提阿人尼哥拉，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这几个人站在使徒面前，使徒在祷告结束后就对其按手祝福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝之道继续传播，耶路撒冷的信徒人数大幅增加，很多祭司也选择坚信了耶稣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["司提芬是一位满受恩惠、拥有上帝力量之人，在民众中施行很多惊人奇迹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但有人开始和他争论，其中有几人来自“自由”",{"noteId":25},"会堂，还有几名古利奈人、亚历山太人、基利家人和亚西亚人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但司提芬所言有圣灵和智慧加持，众人无法占上风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["于是他们唆使其他人，说：“我们听过他说过亵渎摩西和上帝的话！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们还煽动民众、长老、宗教老师，派人来捉拿司提芬，把他带到公议会，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["然后提供假证供说：“这人总是在抨击圣殿",{"noteId":26},"和律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我们听他说过：‘这拿撒勒人耶稣将破坏圣殿，改变摩西传给我们的律法",{"noteId":27},"。’”"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["当时坐在公议会里的所有人都注视着他，他的面孔闪着光，如天使一般。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":24,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“希腊主义者”和“希伯来人。”","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":1}},{"noteId":25,"caller":"+","text":"这应该是由曾经的奴隶组成的教堂。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":9}},{"noteId":26,"caller":"+","text":"原意为“这个圣地”，又见6:14。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":13}},{"noteId":27,"caller":"+","text":"亦译为“风俗”，但这里更多与律法和礼仪要求有关。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/ACT/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/ACT/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/ACT/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}